OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash seconds
OL,4,Aafter failing to stop for police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died seconds after
OL,7,Ffailing to stop for police in
OL,8,FEdinburgh.
OL,10,FTwo officers on routine patrol
OL,11,Fsignalled to the biker to stop in the
OL,12,FSeafield Road area of Leith at about
OL,13,F18:36 on Wednesday.
OL,15,FBut a minute later the 40-year-old, who
OL,16,Fwas travelling on a Yamaha YZF R6
OL,17,Fmotorcycle, was involved in a collision
OL,18,Fwith a vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
