OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash seconds
OL,4,Aafter failing to stop for police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said he was pronounced
OL,7,Fdead at the scene of the incident,
OL,8,Fwhich happened on Salamander Street, at
OL,9,Fthe junction with Bath Road.
